{"2768430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ATLYSS", "steam_appid": 2768430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Enter ATLYSS,</strong></i><strong> a strange world thriving with creatures and critters!</strong> With the outside realm and dungeons deep ahead, there are plenty of locations to explore and discover.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Character Creation -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your character with <strong>five playable races to choose from,</strong> with color, head, and body customization!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Class Advancement -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start off as a witty Novice, destined to choose between three primary classes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighter:</strong> The melee class that rends and staggers foes, dealing devastating damage and threat. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystic:</strong> The caster class that evokes powerful offensive and supportive arcane magic to their advantage. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bandit:</strong> The acrobatic class that are experts of ranged weapons, traps, and quick melee attacks. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Play alone, or with Friends -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience ATLYSS with friends online, or play solo--</strong> <i>no internet connection required!</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Your character, saved locally -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All of your character progression data is saved locally!</strong> Play a character solo, and join in later to a net-play session where you left off, and vice versa. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Questing Abound -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party up with friends and take on quests to slay creatures, discover new locations, and uncover the mystique of the shattered world.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Enter ATLYSS,</strong></i><strong> a strange world thriving with creatures and critters!</strong> With the outside realm and dungeons deep ahead, there are plenty of locations to explore and discover.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Character Creation -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your character with <strong>five playable races to choose from,</strong> with color, head, and body customization!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Class Advancement -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start off as a witty Novice, destined to choose between three primary classes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighter:</strong> The melee class that rends and staggers foes, dealing devastating damage and threat. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystic:</strong> The caster class that evokes powerful offensive and supportive arcane magic to their advantage. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bandit:</strong> The acrobatic class that are experts of ranged weapons, traps, and quick melee attacks. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Play alone, or with Friends -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience ATLYSS with friends online, or play solo--</strong> <i>no internet connection required!</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Your character, saved locally -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All of your character progression data is saved locally!</strong> Play a character solo, and join in later to a net-play session where you left off, and vice versa. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Questing Abound -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party up with friends and take on quests to slay creatures, discover new locations, and uncover the mystique of